# The old towns of Kalos (Camphrier Town, Geosenge Town, Dendemille Town, and Route 10's standing stones): a minuet in
# E minor, an oboe over a harpsichord's oom-pah-pah, a cello answering and the string orchestra under them, as old as
# the stones; at night a flute and a harp. Original composition for this game (plan 23, on plan 31 · MU3's instruments), in the modern sound.
